{"id":"cb0c882121f853e4","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-tmsat.md","title":"有时钟的机器可满足性语言","display":"df-tmsat — 有时钟的机器可满足性语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-tmsat","aliases":["28-df-tmsat"],"display":"df-tmsat — 有时钟的机器可满足性语言","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-godel-numbering]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 2.9 (language TMSAT)","source_printed_pages":"43","source_pdf_pages":"69","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-tmsat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-tmsat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tmsat — 有时钟的机器可满足性语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 2.9 (language TMSAT)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"43"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"69"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a> 定义的确定型机器集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；机器有效编码与可解码元组编码来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a>；四元组采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b,c,d\\rangle=\\langle a,\\langle b,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a,b,c,d\\rangle=\\langle a,\\langle b,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}\">\\(\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^0=\\varepsilon\">\\(1^0=\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMSAT}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x,1^n,1^t\\rangle:\\ M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ x\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ n,t\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\exists u\\in\\Sigma^n\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(\\langle x,u\\rangle)\\;\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le t\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TMSAT}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x,1^n,1^t\\rangle:\\ M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ x\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ n,t\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\exists u\\in\\Sigma^n\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(\\langle x,u\\rangle)\\;\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le t\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一元编码使证书长度n和时钟t均不超过整个实例长度。接受状态代替书中输出1，是本目录判定机约定；无效元组拒绝。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 2.9 (language TMSAT)；印刷 pp.43 / PDF pp.69。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的确定型机器集。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；机器有效编码与可解码元组编码来自 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；四元组采用 $\\langle a,b,c,d\\rangle=\\langle a,\\langle b,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\rangle\\rangle$；$\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]；$n,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$1^0=\\varepsilon$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；机器有效编码与可解码元组编码来自 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；四元组采用 $\\langle a,b,c,d\\rangle=\\langle a,\\langle b,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\rangle\\rangle$；$\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]；$n,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$1^0=\\varepsilon$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a,b,c,d\\rangle=\\langle a,\\langle b,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}","display":false},{"tex":"n,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"1^0=\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TMSAT}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x,1^n,1^t\\rangle:\\ M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ x\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ n,t\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\exists u\\in\\Sigma^n\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(\\langle x,u\\rangle)\\;\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le t\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1647,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-276","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tmsat]]、[[28-thm-tmsat-np-complete]]、[[28-df-binary-integer-programming]]、[[28-thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-np-certificate-search]]。"},{"id":"0b51fbaad5a1434f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TMSAT}$ 见 [[28-df-tmsat]]；$\\mathrm{NPComplete}$ 使用本目录多项式时间多一归约，见 [[28-df-np-complete]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","256220eba4eba968","b54d75aae768415e"]}